{
 "id": 1781996,
 "titulo": "1/25 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1674634130842,
 "modificada": 1733049538639,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1781996",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1642484088451\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6d1abccb364a5981c9cb4a33768459_1642484088451_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Heroes who sense danger with their Spider-Sense<br>\nand defeat their enemies with spider webs have been upgraded.&nbsp;<br>\nAgents, join the Spider-Mens now.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Scarlet Spider, who has turned into <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Chasm</span>, has acquired Tier-3 abilities,<br>\nand <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Spider-Man</span>, who has faced his original self, has acquired Tier-4 abilities.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">In addition, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Arachknight </span>has succeeded<br>\nin controlling his new personality using the technologies of 2099,<br>\nand has acquired Potential Transcendence together with the <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Infinity Warps</span> team.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out their new skills and upgraded powers<br>\nby downloading the 1/25 Patch!</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>■ 1/25 Patch Details</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 1/26 (Thu) 3:00 (UTC+0), 1/25 (Wed) 19:00 (PST)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[1/26 (Thu) 2:56 (UTC+0), 1/25 (Wed) 18:56 (PST) added]</span></p>\n\n<p>The patch has been completed as of 1/26 (Thu) 2:54 (UTC+0), 1/25 (Wed) 18:54 (PST).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> the completion time will be announced</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> once the patch has been finished.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, and the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Three New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Three new Uniforms Spider-Man &lt;Back to Basics&gt;,&nbsp;<br>\nArachknight &lt;Arachknight 2099&gt;, and Chasm &lt;Dark Web&gt; have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The three new Uniforms can be purchased after the 1/25 Patch data is applied.<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1564\" id=\"1674626447134\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/277c343a145543c4a609d4c1965900ec_1674626447134_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1531\" id=\"1674626447150\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1cf0337fdc714c8b94f38aa3028f8e14_1674626447150_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1330\" id=\"1674626447160\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/167119ef2bb04777b9e100e31ae6464a_1674626447160_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Scarlet Spider Tier-3</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Scarlet Spider is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nAs a clone, Scarlet Spider needs powerful abilities to find the answers to his personality.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"349\" id=\"1674626482824\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b104e18c2aca43dd97c345c9c97f7a37_1674626482824_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1674626502749\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/171a0c524bdb4f7bab2426e7c2f66095_1674626502749.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Spider-Man Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Spider-Man is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nSpider-Man will use his new powers in the right way with more responsibility.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"323\" id=\"1674626527532\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/dd73c7db416847f2a8d83be926e8dd9f_1674626527532_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Arachknight, Iron Hammer, Ghost Panther, and Weapon Hex&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">​<br>\nThrough this January Additional Patch, the four members of the Infinity Warps<br>\nhas acquired Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence!<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1596\" id=\"1674626563890\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1c0ab30a260c4606b4257d5b597f8970_1674626563890_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1674626595962\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/70ded8b2685c4038be4d54b4ce5e5297_1674626595962.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1674626595988\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/8cc810f9949449dbb2de1dbf09052dd2_1674626595988.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1674626595978\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/4b5645a46d954ac1b6e4dc3dd5134589_1674626595978.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1674626596000\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/6180ddc59744440e94dfce5c6ec1aa22_1674626596000.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Artifacts for Scarlet Spider, Arachknight, Iron Hammer,&nbsp;<br>\nGhost Panther, and Weapon Hex have been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[1/26 (Thu) 5:35 (UTC+0), 1/25 (Wed) 21:35 (PST)&nbsp;added]</span></p>\n\n<p>The &nbsp;Exclusive Passive Skill effect of the Artifact&nbsp;Claws of Chaos (Weapon Hex) has been changed.</p>\n\n<p>Before: Increases Mind Damage by 30% of Mind Resist,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Increases basic damage dealt to Super Villain faction by 15%</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">After: Ignores target's Dodge Rate by 20%, Increases basic damage dealt to Super Villain faction by 20%</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1674710950603\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0b9da6f04581487c93d5a83c0775dd9a_1674710950603_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Other Improvements and Changes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The Infinity Warps ability has been added in Team - My Team - All Abilities.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Arachknight’s ability ‘Weapons Master’ has been changed to ‘Infinity Warps’.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Iron Hammer’s ability ‘Magic’ has been changed to ‘Infinity Warps’.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The ‘Infinity Warps’ ability has been added to Ghost Panther.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. Weapon Hex’s ability ‘Agility’ has been changed to ‘Infinity Warps’.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1674626684369\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/294386f0159049d7b9ef2cdb541f37c1_1674626684369_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
}